@baseUrl = https://localhost:54235

### 0. Health Check (Anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Login as HR Admin (captures accessToken automatically for all requests below)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin.rh@nova-conseil.fr",
  "password": "SirhDemo123!"
}

### 2. Current User Profile (/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3. Organization Referentials
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contract-types
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referentials/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4. Employees (HumanResources)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
# Example: Create a new employee (replace companyId with an ID returned by GET /api/v1/companies)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "directManagerId": null,
  "honorific": "M",
  "firstName": "Lucas",
  "lastName": "Martin",
  "initialPassword": "NewEmployee123!",
  "roleCodes": [ "EMPLOYEE" ],
  "departments": [ "DEPT_IT" ]
}

### 5. Contracts & Models
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contract-models
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 6. Health & Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/medical-visits
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 7. Internal Life (Docs, CSE, RSE, Onboarding Quizzes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/common-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/staff-representatives
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rse-ideas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding-quizzes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Optional quick logins for Manager / Standard Employee testing
